WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:01,840
Want to escape

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,660
You offended my brother Yuan and you still want to leave

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,940
My feelings for Brother Yuan are so obvious

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,220
He actually asked me to deal with Brother Yuan

5
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,560
Too much deception

6
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,640
I pay you to do something

7
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,800
If you don't let go, come over and do something to me

8
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,020
This is the 3S level original ghost weapon

9
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,580
Ghost Beast Waiter

10
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,580
Each time it is used, life is lost

11
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,460
This is all forced by you

12
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,820
Even if you lose weight today

13
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,380
I'll make you pay the price too

14
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,970
3S level original ghost soldier
